369 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Square Pharmaceuticals PLC is the largest and most trusted pharmaceutical company in Bangladesh, dominating the market for more than three decades. Founded in 1958 by the visionary entrepreneur Samson H. Chowdhury. Square Pharma has grown from a small local firm into a global player in the healthcare industry. Since 1985, it has consistently maintained the No. 1 position in the Bangladeshi pharmaceutical market in terms of revenue, market share, and product reach. The company became a public limited company in 1991 and was officially listed on the Dhaka and Chattogram Stock Exchanges in 1995. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [10 11]
>>
endobj
370 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Square Pharma is recognized as the first Bangladeshi company to export medicines abroad \(1987\). Today, it exports a wide range of pharmaceutical products, including antibiotics, cardiovascular drugs, gastro-intestinal medicines, respiratory treatments, and herbal products, to 42 countries across Asia, Africa, and Latin America. This global presence highlights its reputation for quality, affordability, and reliability. Also, from the early 2024 Squre Pharma started their production operation by establishing 20 million dollar plant.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
