453 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Pharmaceutical sector is one of the mature and rapidly expanding industry in Bangladesh which meets 98% domestic medicine demand which has grown strongly over the last decade and is inreasingly exporting generics to global markets. In the 2023-2024 fiscal year the export has reached to about USD 213 Million. However, major near term structural issues are heavy API \(Active Pharmaceutical Ingredients\) Import dependence and the looming end of TRIPS flexibilities tied to LDC status \(Graduation expected November 2026\) which together determine how fast Bangladesh can move up the value chain into higher margin medicine. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [9 10]
>>
