460 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The domestic market size of Bangladesh's pharmaceutical industry reached approximately USD 3.39 billion by the end of 2024, with a 17.7% growth in the last quarter of 2024. There are currently around 265 pharmaceutical companies registered with the Directorate General of Drug Administration \(DGDA\) in Bangladesh.The industry meets over 98% of domestic demand and is projected to continue strong growth, becoming a $6 billion market by 2026.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [12]
>>
