<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (After the RMG and the Leather sector Pharmaceutical sector is in the third position in terms of generating the export revenue. From the last 10 years this sector have seen an journey where the export run from 89 million to 225 Million USD .)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [6]
>>
