481 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (pharmaceutical exports reached US$225 million in FY 2024-25 more than doubling over the last seven years. The Bangladesh government has declared pharmaceuticals a "Thrust Sector" to encourage growth and global expansion that has been designated by a government as a priority sector for investment and development due to its potential to drive economic growth and utilize local resources. These sectors receive incentives, subsidies, and support to encourage investment and help them become a significant part of the state's economy. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [7 8]
>>
