486 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The most significant destinations for these exports include Sri Lanka, Pakistan, the Philippines, and Myanmar, with Myanmar accounting for 14.72% of total exports in a previous period. Along with this the huge African market is a becoming a great potential target for the Pharmaceutical industry. Because of the price sensitive market and as well as the less regulation its make this market more favorable. As a result we can see that Square Pharmaceutical LTD had already established their own subsidiary in kenya Nairobi. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3 4]
>>
