512 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The threat of new entrants in the pharmaceutical industry in Bangladesh can be considered to be moderate to low. This is because, even though there are a lot of new emerging companies with a promising future and high growth potential due to technological and product advancements, market giants such as Square Pharmaceuticals, Incepta, Beximco, Renata, etc have a strong market presence and hence it will still be a challenge for the new entrants to be able to dominate the existing market scenario.    )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [9 10]
>>
endobj
