/Pg 23 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
514 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Substitute products to drugs and medication such as ayurvedic, herbal, homeopathic drug manufacturing companies are producing some drugs that have the same function as that of the drugs produced by the pharmaceutical giants in our country. Yet, the market demand for these substitutes is still considered low compared to the drugs produced by the local pharmaceutical companies, and hence we can say the threat of substitute products is low in the industry as maintaining the same quality and affordability of the alternate drugs can be considered a big challenge. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [12 13]
>>
