516 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Since the pharmaceutical industry in Bangladesh largely depends on the import of Active Pharmaceutical Ingredients \(API\), hence the suppliers of APIs have a high bargaining power. Bangladesh depends on countries like China, Germany, Switzerland, etc for the import of APIs as there is currently no API manufacturing plant made for the domestic market \(Bangladesh.uz \). This gives the international suppliers a strong bargaining power. )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
endobj
