/S /P
/E (Impact: Medium  Likelihood: Medium)
/Pg 46 0 R
/K [24]
>>
endobj
744 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The pharmaceutical market in Bangladesh is highly competitive with many companies competing to capture generic, branded generic and niche therapeutic markets. Although Square has a significant market share \(roughly 17%\), its growth in the domestic market depends on how it can retain its brand loyalty, price sensitivity, and reduce the aggressive pricing and marketing strategies of the competitors. Therefore, a shifts of domestic demand, any changes in regulations on the price of drugs, or aggressive actions of competitors might put the margins or increase in volume under strain of Square.)
/Pg 46 0 R
/K [25]
>>
endobj
