/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Bangladesh is currently in the care of an interim government after a period of political change thus increasing uncertainty to businesses and investors. In the case of Square Pharmaceuticals, this instability might cripple logistical processes, delay expansion programs and snuff out domestic demand. More importantly, the turbulent political situation can discourage foreign investors to invest new funds, which can in turn affect valuations multiples and liquidity of listed shares.  )
/Pg 46 0 R
/K [31 32]
>>
