754 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Square still continues to import a large percentage of the active pharmaceutical ingredients and other raw materials which form the basic ingredients of its products. Disruption of global supply-chains, rising freight cost, trade bans and currency instability in turn present huge challenges to the cost and the sustainability of production. Even though Square is currently working on building local capacity of its API in the Gazaria API Industrial Park, that capacity should be fully functional and expanded to such a size that it makes a difference in the level of its dependency.)
/Pg 46 0 R
