/E (Square has been engaged in significant initiatives that are meant to modernise and increase its manufacturing base. However, these projects are expected to involve risks of delays, cost overruns, under-utilisation in case the projected demand does not materialise or other reasons which are related to the technology integration. Such capital costs may inflate, returns on investment may diminish or operational cash flows may put too much strain on the issue of any such execution.)
