/E (Since a significant amount of inputs imported by Square and the export revenues can be received in different currencies, this exposes Square to depreciation of the BDT. Such a sudden change in the value of the currency might significantly add to the costs and reduce the margins, in case Square cannot either pass these costs to its customers or is under an obligation of a fixed contract.)
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [6]
