<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The heavy investments that Square is undertaking in modernizing plants, constructing API facilities, and capacity development are capital-heavy, and can limit cash flows in the short term. In case the implementation of the project is slowed down or the surge in revenue growth is not realized according to the plan, the cycles of working-capital might be lengthened, the leverage might rise and the returns on the invested capital could be reduced, which would strain the returns on the shareholders.)
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
