773 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The production process of pharmaceutical products is energy consuming, with significant use of high quality raw materials, and needs experienced labor. So the stable cost of raw materials, labour, and utilities like electricity, gas, and water is very significant for companies like Square. Unfortunately, in the recent past the price of the inputs varied a lot. The rise in costs of these inputs due to inflation and disruption to supply of energy or rising fuel prices directly threaten the cost base of Square. Even in case of growing revenues, margins can decline, especially in low-margin generics.)
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [13]
>>
